{"seq":9,"slug":"language-acquisition","title":"语言习得","stage":"DONE","category":"linguistics","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition","rating":{"composite":4.05,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"语言习得\">语言习得</h1><p>每一个正常的孩子，都会在短短几年之内、不需要任何正式的教学，就掌握一门极其复杂的语言——能理解和说出他从未听过的句子，能运用一套连语言学家都未必能完全描述清楚的语法规则。与此对照，一个成年人想学会一门外语，往往要付出巨大努力，却仍难以达到母语者的水平。儿童如何能毫不费力地习得母语？成人学外语为何如此困难？<strong>语言习得</strong>正是研究人类如何获得语言能力的领域——它从&quot;孩子如何学说话&quot;这一最寻常的现象出发，最终引向关于人类心智、知识来源、人之为人的最深刻问题。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向对语言、心智与学习感兴趣的读者，<strong>无需语言学背景</strong>，系统讲解语言习得从儿童母语习得到外语学习的核心知识与争论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么-与兄弟-hub-的边界\">本 hub 讲什么，不讲什么（与兄弟 hub 的边界）</h2><p>语言习得问的是一个独特的问题：语言能力是<strong>如何被获得</strong>的。它与几个相邻领域高度交叠，但侧重点判然有别。读者若发现自己真正想问的是相邻问题，可直接转向对应 hub。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想了解的问题</th>\n<th>该去的 hub</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的分工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言能力如何被<strong>获得</strong>（习得阶段、先天后天、关键期、二语）</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub：语言习得</strong></td>\n<td>聚焦&quot;获得过程&quot;本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心智如何<strong>实时处理</strong>语言（理解、产出、词汇通达）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../psycholinguistics/\">心理语言学</a></td>\n<td>处理而非获得；习得只是其一章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言的<strong>大脑机制</strong>（语言区、神经通路、失语症、成像证据）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../neurolinguistics/\">神经语言学</a></td>\n<td>神经底层；本 hub 只在关键期处借用其证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言与<strong>思维、概念、隐喻</strong>的关系（基于用法的语法）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../cognitive-linguistics/\">认知语言学</a></td>\n<td>意义与概念化；本 hub 借其构式观看经验论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>怎样<strong>高效学好外语</strong>（方法、工具、迁移、可理解输入）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../learning/multilingual-learning/\">多语学习</a>、<a href=\"../../english-learning/english-thinking-acquisition/\">英语思维与习得</a></td>\n<td>学习实践与策略；本 hub 讲二语习得的<strong>理论与机制</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识/能力<strong>天生还是后天</strong>的哲学根问</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../philosophy-logic/epistemology/\">认识论</a>、<a href=\"../../philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-mind/\">心智哲学</a></td>\n<td>哲学根基；本 hub 给出语言这一具体战场的经验证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言<strong>结构本身</strong>（语音、语法、语义）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../phonetics-phonology/\">音系学</a>、<a href=\"../morphology-syntax/\">形态句法</a>、<a href=\"../semantics-pragmatics/\">语义语用</a></td>\n<td>习得的&quot;分析对象&quot;；研究儿童如何习得语法，先得懂语法是什么</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：本 hub 不教你&quot;语言是什么&quot;（那是语言结构诸 hub），也不直接教你&quot;怎么把外语学好&quot;（那是多语学习诸 hub），而是揭示&quot;语言能力为何能、又如何被人类获得&quot;这一根本机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><p>五章循序展开：基础 → 母语习得过程 → 先天与后天之争 → 关键期假说 → 二语习得与意义。多数读者<strong>顺序通读</strong>即可。下表给出按目标分流的捷径。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>人群 / 目标</th>\n<th>建议路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初次接触、想要全貌</td>\n<td>第一章 → 第二章 → 第三章 → 第四章 → 第五章（完整顺读）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只想抓住核心争论</td>\n<td><a href=\"foundations/poverty-of-stimulus\">刺激的贫乏</a> → <a href=\"nature-vs-nurture/the-core-question\">争论的核心问题</a> → <a href=\"nature-vs-nurture/nativism\">先天论</a> → <a href=\"nature-vs-nurture/empiricism\">经验论</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>家长 / 关心儿童语言发展</td>\n<td><a href=\"foundations/the-miracle\">母语习得的奇迹</a> → <a href=\"first-language-acquisition/stages\">习得的阶段</a> → <a href=\"first-language-acquisition/creative-errors-and-input\">创造性错误</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外语学习者 / 教师</td>\n<td><a href=\"critical-period/what-is-critical-period\">关键期假说</a> → <a href=\"second-language-and-significance/l2-vs-l1\">二语与母语异同</a> → <a href=\"second-language-and-significance/factors-in-l2\">影响二语的因素</a>，再延伸到<a href=\"../../learning/multilingual-learning/\">多语学习</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关心心智 / 哲学意涵</td>\n<td><a href=\"nature-vs-nurture/the-core-question\">先天与后天之争</a> → <a href=\"second-language-and-significance/window-to-language\">通向语言本质的窗口</a> → <a href=\"second-language-and-significance/significance\">意义与启示</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>几乎不需要语言学背景</strong>：核心概念（母语、语法、规则、输入）都在文中界定，从零讲起。</li>\n<li>涉及英语动词时态、复数等举例（如 go→went、过度规则化生造&quot;goed&quot;），有基础英语常识即可，无需专业语法训练。</li>\n<li>第三章&quot;先天与后天&quot;会触及理性主义 vs 经验主义这一哲学背景，但文中已自足解释；想深究可参阅<a href=\"../../philosophy-logic/epistemology/nature-of-knowledge/knowledge-types\">认识论：知识的类型</a>。</li>\n<li>想先建立语言学整体地图的读者，可从<a href=\"../linguistics-overview/\">语言学概览</a>入手，再回到本 hub。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本知识库，你将理解人类如何获得语言这一最独特的能力，并对&quot;孩子如何学说话&quot;这一寻常现象背后关于心智本质的深刻问题，形成自己的认识。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"语言习得的基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-language-acquisition","title":"什么是语言习得","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/foundations/what-is-language-acquisition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-miracle","title":"母语习得的奇迹","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/foundations/the-miracle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"poverty-of-stimulus","title":"刺激的贫乏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/foundations/poverty-of-stimulus"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"first-language-acquisition","title":"母语习得的过程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/first-language-acquisition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stages","title":"习得的阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/first-language-acquisition/stages"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regularity-and-universality","title":"规律性与普遍性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/first-language-acquisition/regularity-and-universality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"creative-errors-and-input","title":"创造性错误与输入的作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/first-language-acquisition/creative-errors-and-input"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"nature-vs-nurture","title":"先天与后天之争","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/nature-vs-nurture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-core-question","title":"争论的核心问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/nature-vs-nurture/the-core-question"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nativism","title":"先天论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/nature-vs-nurture/nativism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"empiricism","title":"经验论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/nature-vs-nurture/empiricism"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"critical-period","title":"关键期假说","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/critical-period","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-critical-period","title":"关键期假说的含义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/critical-period/what-is-critical-period"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evidence-and-debate","title":"证据与争论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/critical-period/evidence-and-debate"},{"seq":3,"slug":"implications","title":"关键期的意涵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/critical-period/implications"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"second-language-and-significance","title":"第二语言习得与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/second-language-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"l2-vs-l1","title":"二语习得与母语习得的异同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/second-language-and-significance/l2-vs-l1"},{"seq":2,"slug":"factors-in-l2","title":"影响二语习得的因素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/second-language-and-significance/factors-in-l2"},{"seq":3,"slug":"window-to-language","title":"通向语言本质的窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/second-language-and-significance/window-to-language"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"语言习得的意义与启示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/language-acquisition/second-language-and-significance/significance"}]}]}